PASS: REAPER_WAKEUP_HANDSHAKE_RETAINED: producer arriving during drain cannot lose its wakeup
PASS: EXIT_RETURNS_FAILURE_IF_QUEUE_NOT_DRAINED: cleanup result is explicit to resource owners
PASS: COMPAT_HEADER_EXPOSES_BOOL_EXIT: callers must check teardown completion
