PASS: LEGACY_FREE_QUARANTINES_OWNER: legacy object stays alive while compat runtime is retained
PASS: WCL_CLOSE_PROPAGATES_TEARDOWN_FAILURE: WCL close returns busy instead of success on failed compat exit
PASS: WCL_BACKEND_RETAINS_DMA_AND_LEASE: WCL PCI/DMA owner remains retained on failed compat drain
PASS: WCL_FREE_QUARANTINES_BACKEND: WCL backend is not destroyed after failed deferred drain
PASS: CONTROLLER_RETAINS_CHILD_ON_CLOSE_FAILURE: controller keeps backend and workloop owned
PASS: CONTROLLER_FREE_ALREADY_QUARANTINES: controller free path preserves parent lifetime on child failure
PASS: FULL_TX_STATUS_CALLBACK_HAS_ADMISSION_GATE: callback lifetime is counted before entering radio completion code
PASS: QUIESCE_CLOSES_GATE_AND_JOINS_ACTIVE_CALLBACKS: teardown waits until the entire synchronous status callback has returned
PASS: STATUS_DISPATCH_GATE_COVERS_COMPLETION_AND_SKB_ENQUEUE: the lease spans completion publication and final skb enqueue
PASS: COMPAT_EXIT_QUIESCES_CALLBACK_BEFORE_REAPER_DRAIN: no in-flight callback can enqueue after final thread-call join
PASS: LEGACY_RADIO_RELEASE_FOLLOWS_CALLBACK_QUIESCE: legacy radio object stays alive until all status callbacks return
PASS: WCL_COMPLETION_WORKER_RELEASE_FOLLOWS_CALLBACK_QUIESCE: WCL token reaper/worker remains alive until the enclosing callback exits
